N5008 [temp.variadic]/5 + [dcl.init.aggr].  A variadic function template whose
body expands a pack of CALLS inside a BRACED (aggregate) initializer
(`return box{fwd(e)...}`).  Previously the instantiate-time body pack expander
handled a pack in a function-CALL argument list but not in a braced initializer,
so `fwd(e)...` was mis-expanded to a single `fwd(e$0, e$1)` and the body was
dropped ("no body for callee").  Fixed by expanding an ID_initializer_list's
pack-expansion elements like function-call arguments.  Non-vacuous: the result
is a concrete function of the forwarded arguments.
